                              "description": "(Required) "
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        "description": "Approves the specified Delivery. This link is included when a Transaction is retrieved from a Poller Bucket or via an Inbound HTTP Communication Channel.\n\nIf this Delivery is the most recent one associated with a Transaction, this will update the Transaction's `deliveryStatus` to `DELIVERED`.\n\nIf this Delivery is associated with one or more Transactions in a Poller Bucket, this will also remove the Transactions from that Bucket."
